 4. 🕔 After hours: Investment-grade Bond 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Amazon MGM Studios released this image promoting Robert Pattinson as the new James Bond. Photo: Amazon

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Bond — James Bond — will be Robert Pattinson.

 State of play: Amazon MGM Studios announced today that Pattinson — the star, most recently, of the Chris Hansen crime thriller "Primetime" — will be the next 007.

 The pick comes after an exhaustive search that also considered Callum Turner, Nicholas Hoult, Josh O'Connor and Jack Lowden, EW reported . The 40-year-old Pattinson — who starred in "Twilight" years ago and, more recently, as Batman — is the "smart but safe choice," The Hollywood Reporter says . What's next: "Dune" director Denis Villeneuve is directing the next Bond film, which is expected to arrive in 2028, per BBC .

 
 
